            "title": "Format and build confidence before\n‍\n",
            "titleBold": true,
            "blocks": [
              {
                "kind": "paragraph",
                "paragraph": {
                  "text": "Were invited to share the moments where support mattered most, and those conversations shaped a clear plan for the first year. Every new programme launched with a small pilot group, so the team could listen closely, adjust the format and build confidence before rolling it out across every region. People responded well to bite-sized videos, quick reads and guided activities that felt relevant to their own roles, and completion rates rose steadily as a result. Leaders noticed the change in team meetings, where colleagues started sharing tips and recommending resources to each other without being asked. Clear dashboards made it easy to.",
                  "linkPhrases": [],
                  "boldPhrases": []
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "title": "Rose steadily as a result Leaders",
            "titleBold": true,
            "blocks": [
              {
                "kind": "spacer"
              },
              {
                "kind": "paragraph",
                "paragraph": {
                  "text": "Relevant to their own roles, and completion rates rose steadily as a result. Leaders noticed the change in team meetings, where colleagues started sharing tips and recommending resources to each other without being asked. Clear dashboards made it easy to see which topics landed and where to focus next, so the plan stayed flexible and grounded in real feedback from the people using it every week. Over time the platform became the natural home for onboarding, product updates and everyday questions, replacing scattered documents and long.",
                  "linkPhrases": [],
                  "boldPhrases": []
                }
              },
              {
                "kind": "heading",
                "heading": "Result Leaders noticed the",
                "headingBold": true
              },
              {
                "kind": "spacer"
              },
              {
                "kind": "paragraph",
                "paragraph": {
                  "text": "To focus next, so the plan stayed flexible and grounded in real feedback from the people using it every week. Over time the platform became the natural home for onboarding, product updates and everyday questions, replacing scattered documents and long email chains with one calm and familiar place to learn. New starters reached confidence faster, experienced colleagues found fresh ways to grow, and the whole organisation began to.",
                  "linkPhrases": [],
                  "boldPhrases": []
